# Intelligence Design System Adherence

- Intelligence is a brand new, standalone project. It is intentionally decoupled from the katiesiu
  portfolio and must not import from or reuse anything under `app/page.tsx`, `app/ctv`,
  `app/campaign-planner`, `features/ctv`, `features/campaign-planner`, `features/design-system`,
  or the portfolio's Figma frame (`26:15603`).
- For any UI/design decisions in `app/intelligence/**` or `features/intelligence/**`, read and
  follow `.agents/skills/design-taste-frontend/SKILL.md` (installed via `npx skills add
  Leonxlnx/taste-skill --skill "design-taste-frontend"`) before writing markup or styles. That
  skill is the source of truth for layout, typography, motion, color, and its pre-flight checklist.
- Design tokens for Intelligence live in `features/intelligence/tokens.ts`. Populate it following
  the skill's Section 1 (dials) and Section 4 (typography/color) guidance once a concrete brief or
  brand direction is provided, rather than inventing values ad hoc.
- The skill does not bundle icons or images. Use its Section 3.C icon-library allowlist (Phosphor,
  HugeIcons, Radix Icons, Tabler) and Section 4.8 image strategy (image-gen tool, then Picsum
  placeholders, then explicit placeholder slots) — do not hand-roll SVG icons or illustrations.
